{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc \"rg -n 'D745|D744|D743|D742' docs/DECISIONS-log.md docs/DECISIONS.md; wc -l docs/prd/10-filing-phase.md docs/CURRENT_STATE.md\"","aggregated_output":"docs/DECISIONS.md:1086:| D742 | 2026-11-22 | v13s re-run STOP: S4 refused a sound answer that computed a guidance rate straight into Q4 (request pulled three ways); council 56–56c: blanket and narrowed exemptions both let a reset to guidance publish, so S4 stays and the request states one rule (guidance informs the pace; the pace is an estimate naming its benchmark; the quarter's dollar value is the one forecast); refusal review registers sound and stated apart; two reader splits disclosed (O's $18B reading, prose numbers); third $0 blind run next | in force | `docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/BLIND2-RESULT.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:1087:| D743 | 2026-11-22 | third v13s blind run: writers clean (12/12 accepted, D742 rule followed by all six P writers); STOP as written on R01 (both readers marked a range across a rung edge; both adjudicators rejected under the schema's range clause; cause: reader brief lacks that clause, Claude's error); disclosures R07 unsupported 90% share, O $18B split, R01 total-capex reference; council 57: ask Alex to authorize a blinded re-read of the 12 replies with the corrected brief and controls; Alex: \"补上那条，重读一遍\" | in force | `docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/BLIND3-RESULT.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:1088:| D744 | 2026-11-22 | D743 re-read: range repair works on both controls; STOP as written on Q10 (both readers marked the permitted plus-or-minus midpoint; both adjudicators rejected; 11 such marks across four readings); one mechanism: readers lack the writer's format rules; council 58: shared rule text for readers and adjudicators, five clean controls, ask Alex for one bounded re-read; S 90% reply flipped between reader sets; Alex: \"批准再重读一次\" | in force | `docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/BLIND3-RESULT.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:1089:| D745 | 2026-11-23 | D744 re-read: readers calibrated (5/5 controls, no shared false mark); STOP on a qualifier-list gap (\"an estimated\" forced to none) and on S zero usable (unsupported data-center share decides the band; E's 15% cut the same); council 59: targeted $0 test of one clarification (show evidence or a supported bound for a band-deciding deduction, else unresolved) plus the qualifier fix; Alex: \"批准针对性小测\", and a justified unresolved answer counts as usable (\"算合格\") | in force | `docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/BLIND3-RESULT.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11369:## D742 · 2026-11-22 · The v13s re-run stops on one sound answer refused by S4; council 56–56c keeps S4 and makes the request state one benchmark rule; a third $0 blind run follows\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11408:     The stop lines are unchanged (`SMALL-DESIGN.md` §5 [D742]).\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11416:## D743 · 2026-11-22 · The third v13s blind run stops on the reader brief; the writer side is clean; council 57 asks Alex to authorize a re-reading\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11421:    - all six P-family writers recorded the Q4 pace as an estimate naming its benchmark (D742's rule);\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11449:## D744 · 2026-11-22 · The D743 re-read fixes the range rule but stops on the midpoint; one mechanism (readers lack the writer's format rules); council 58 asks Alex for one more bounded re-read under shared rule text\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11484:## D745 · 2026-11-23 · The D744 re-read calibrates the readers but stops on a qualifier-list gap and on S's unsupported share; council 59 recommends a targeted $0 test of one clarification, for Alex to authorize\n     201 docs/prd/10-filing-phase.md\n    1056 docs/CURRENT_STATE.md\n    1257 total\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
